  "prefLabel": "Per 102.77 Reduction in force",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.77 “Reduction in force” means a condition in which the total number of employees within an agency is reduced due to a layoff.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-9; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.47); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.48) ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.64); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.66), eff 12-1-25",
